    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Æfre ymb IX niht gebyreð betweox ðam stæðum, þæt man oðrum riht wyrce ge æt lade ge æt ælcere spræce, þe him betweox bið.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Depending on [the passing of the] 9 days, it [should] happen that the rights of the each side on either bank are respected, both at exculpation and [any legal] communication which may take place between them.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Semper ad nouem noctes decet inter stationes, ut rectum faciat alius alii et de lada et de alia causa, que inter eos sit.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
